{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/marcopollara-vitanuova/euro_american/pull/5","repo":"marcopollara-vitanuova/euro_american","number":5,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Redesign role-based Axieme platform UX","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n- Split the product into distinct Console MGA and Portale Distributore shells with grouped, collapsible navigation instead of one dense sidebar.\n- Reworked the login page for stronger contrast, accessible labels, clearer demo profiles, and role-aware post-login routing.\n- Rebuilt admin and distributor dashboards around operating to-do lists plus KPI panoramas.\n- Reduced the quote wizard from 8 steps to 4 macro-steps and wired it to existing quote APIs for create, answer save, pricing, proposal, payment link, simulated payment, policy issue, and OTP signature mock actions.\n- Added operational pages for customer create/detail history, quote detail tabs/actions, admin referral decisions, document signed URLs, and policy detail documents/payments/signatures.\n- Added runtime demo state for payments/signatures/generated documents and guarded policy issue behind approved referral + captured payment.\n- Documented MVP runtime status and deploy readiness constraints.\n\n## Walkthrough\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-37c1a5a0-4fc2-4965-84c1-948e41009f04/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Faxieme_operational_workflows_walkthrough.mp4\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-271ad668-18b5-4833-99d5-23d28ea6025d\" alt=\"axieme_operational_workflows_walkthrough.mp4\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-37c1a5a0-4fc2-4965-84c1-948e41009f04/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Faxieme_signed_url_layout_fixed.mp4\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-90c3018b-6b2e-44fd-a06e-dbde5d9fb834\" alt=\"axieme_signed_url_layout_fixed.mp4\" /></a>\n![Customer create success](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-d7929aa5-c228-45d5-885b-3d18f179b1d3)\n![Structured customer detail](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-69154491-c2db-4d28-a2e0-b865e6903f5f)\n![Quote actions complete](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-fd29771c-e7f7-4f94-8e71-e3225c892733)\n![Admin referral approved](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-d26178ed-ce00-44ee-96e4-d585839de5c5)\n![Signed URL layout fixed](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-c5af5f34-1572-47ed-b151-d5126d8089db)\n\n## Validation\n- `env -u DATABASE_URL npm test` -> HARNESS validator passed, pytest passed, Prisma Client generated, TypeScript strict passed.\n- `env -u DATABASE_URL npm run build` -> Next.js production build passed.\n- `npm run test:security` -> npm audit found 0 moderate+ vulnerabilities and HARNESS validation passed.\n- Manual browser workflow -> customer create, structured customer detail, quote actions, admin referral assign/approve, signed URL generation and layout verified.\n- `gh pr checks 5 --json name,bucket,state,workflow,link` -> Vercel Preview Comments, Vercel euro-american, and Vercel workspace all passed.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-37c1a5a0-4fc2-4965-84c1-948e41009f04\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-37c1a5a0-4fc2-4965-84c1-948e41009f04\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n",